    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολῡμ-αντήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύμη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>destroyer</i>:
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιτῶν ἀ.</span>
